1 INTRODUCTION
Specifying the scope of use of a dataset is an important step before
sharing it [ 41]. Particularly, it is known that data-driven models are
not reliable and may be unfair towards the groups that are not well
represented in their (training) dataset [ 36,37]. Therefore, it is im-
portant to identify the potential groups that are under-represented
